{
  "analysis": "The SKILL.md file was truncated in the output. I can see it outlines 24 AI writing patterns to detect and remove. I need to see the full content to understand all patterns, but I already have enough context from the draft.txt and notes.txt to start humanizing. The draft has clear AI patterns: 'rapidly evolving digital landscape', 'testament to commitment', 'leverages robust comprehensive framework', 'holistic approach', 'unlocking transformative outcomes', etc.",
  "plan": "Let me read the full SKILL.md file to see all patterns, then create the humanized version of draft.txt and a report of changes.",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "head -200 skill_context/SKILL.md\\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    }
  ]
}

{
  "analysis": "I've successfully created the humanized.txt file with a natural, human-sounding version of the draft. The changes_report.txt file was also created. Let me verify the report file was created correctly.",
